{"route":"/rules","title":"Доставки Хубенов — Колети Великобритания ⇄ България","description":"Бързи и надеждни колетни пратки между Великобритания и България. Собствен транспорт, курс всеки петък от Манчестър. Достъп до врата и офис на Еконт.","lang":"bg","html":"<div class=\"flex min-h-screen flex-col\"><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-border/70 bg-background/85 backdrop-blur-lg\"><div class=\"container flex h-16 items-center justify-between gap-4\"><a class=\"shrink-0\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 font-display font-extrabold\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" class=\"h-9 w-9 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"64\" height=\"64\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"hsl(var(--brand))\"></rect><path d=\"M14 24l18-9 18 9v16l-18 9-18-9V24z\" fill=\"#fff\" fill-opacity=\"0.08\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M14 24l18 9 18-9M32 33v16\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"15\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"hsl(var(--accent))\"></circle></svg><span class=\"leading-none\"><span class=\"block text-base tracking-tight text-foreground\">Доставки Хубенов</span><span class=\"block text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted-fg\">UK ⇄ BG</span></span></span></a><nav class=\"hidden items-center gap-0.5 lg:flex xl:gap-1\"><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap rounded-lg px-2.5 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors xl:px-3 text-muted-fg hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/\">Начало</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap rounded-lg px-2.5 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors xl:px-3 text-muted-fg hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/services\">Услуги</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap rounded-lg px-2.5 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors xl:px-3 text-muted-fg hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/quote\">Оферта</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap rounded-lg px-2.5 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors xl:px-3 text-muted-fg hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/track\">Проследяване</a><div class=\"relative\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg px-2.5 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors xl:px-3 text-muted-fg hover:text-foreground\">Офиси<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform duration-200\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap rounded-lg px-2.5 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors xl:px-3 text-muted-fg hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/coverage\">Покритие</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap rounded-lg px-2.5 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors xl:px-3 text-muted-fg hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/about\">За нас</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap rounded-lg px-2.5 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors xl:px-3 text-muted-fg hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/faq\">Въпроси</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap rounded-lg px-2.5 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors xl:px-3 text-muted-fg hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/contact\">Контакти</a></nav><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><button aria-label=\"Смени езика\" class=\"items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-muted-fg hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground transition-colors hidden sm:flex\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-languages h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"m5 8 6 6\"></path><path d=\"m4 14 6-6 2-3\"></path><path d=\"M2 5h12\"></path><path d=\"M7 2h1\"></path><path d=\"m22 22-5-10-5 10\"></path><path d=\"M14 18h6\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-foreground\">БГ</span><span class=\"text-muted-fg\">/</span><span class=\"\">EN</span></button><button aria-label=\"Смени темата\" class=\"inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-muted-fg hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-moon h-4.5 w-4.5\"><path d=\"M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z\"></path></svg></button><a class=\"hidden sm:block\" href=\"/login\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl font-semibold transition-all focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none active:scale-[0.98] border border-input bg-transparent hover:bg-muted h-9 px-3 text-sm\">Вход</button></a><button class=\"inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-muted lg:hidden\" aria-label=\"Меню\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu h-5 w-5\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><section class=\"container py-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl\"><div class=\"mb-6 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4\"><div><h1 class=\"font-display text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-3xl\">Правила за пратки</h1><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-fg\">Какво приемаме, какво е забранено и как да опаковате — за бърза и безпроблемна доставка.</p></div></div><div class=\"space-y-5\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-card text-card-fg shadow-soft border-success/30\"><div class=\"p-6\"><p class=\"mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 font-display font-bold text-foreground\"><span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-success/15 text-success\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check h-4.5 w-4.5\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>Приемаме</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-fg\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-success\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg> Дрехи, обувки, текстил</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-success\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg> Запечатани нетрайни храни</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-success\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg> Козметика (незапалима)</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-success\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg> Книги, играчки, домашни стоки</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-success\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg> Електроника (с обявена стойност)</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-success\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg> Документи и подаръци</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-card text-card-fg shadow-soft border-danger/30\"><div class=\"p-6\"><p class=\"mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 font-display font-bold text-foreground\"><span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-danger/15 text-danger\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-ban h-4.5 w-4.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m4.9 4.9 14.2 14.2\"></path></svg></span>Забранени (не приемаме)</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-fg\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-ban mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-danger\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m4.9 4.9 14.2 14.2\"></path></svg> Наркотици и психоактивни вещества</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-ban mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-danger\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m4.9 4.9 14.2 14.2\"></path></svg> Оръжия, боеприпаси, взривове, пиротехника</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-ban mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-danger\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m4.9 4.9 14.2 14.2\"></path></svg> Запалими и под налягане: газ, аерозоли, запалки, бои, разтворители</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-ban mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-danger\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m4.9 4.9 14.2 14.2\"></path></svg> Корозивни и токсични химикали</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-ban mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-danger\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m4.9 4.9 14.2 14.2\"></path></svg> Пари в брой, карти, чекове, бижута и благородни метали</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-ban mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-danger\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m4.9 4.9 14.2 14.2\"></path></svg> Живи животни и растения</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-ban mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-danger\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m4.9 4.9 14.2 14.2\"></path></svg> Нетрайни храни без подходяща опаковка / изискващи хладилник</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-ban mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-danger\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m4.9 4.9 14.2 14.2\"></path></svg> Фалшиви стоки и незаконни материали</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-ban mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-danger\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m4.9 4.9 14.2 14.2\"></path></svg> Всичко забранено от законите на Великобритания и България</li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border bg-card text-card-fg shadow-soft border-warning/40\"><div class=\"p-6\"><p class=\"mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 font-display font-bold text-foreground\"><span class=\"flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-warning/20 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert h-4.5 w-4.5\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg></span>С условия (декларирайте предварително)</p><ul class=\"grid gap-2 text-sm text-muted-fg sm:grid-cols-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-amber-500\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg> Литиеви батерии — само монтирани в устройството; отделни батерии не се приемат</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-amber-500\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg> Алкохол и тютюн — с ограничения и мита; декларирайте</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-amber-500\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg> Течности — запечатани, незапалими, добре опаковани</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-amber-500\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg> Лекарства — лични количества, в оригинална опаковка</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-amber-500\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg> Ценни предмети — застраховайте/декларирайте; не препоръчваме незаменими вещи</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card text-card-fg shadow-soft\"><div class=\"p-6\"><p class=\"mb-2 flex items-center gap-2 font-display font-bold text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-package h-4.5 w-4.5 text-brand-700\"><path d=\"M11 21.73a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73z\"></path><path d=\"M12 22V12\"></path><path d=\"m3.3 7 7.703 4.734a2 2 0 0 0 1.994 0L20.7 7\"></path><path d=\"m7.5 4.27 9 5.15\"></path></svg> Опаковане</p><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-fg\">Използвайте здрава кутия и пълнеж, запечатайте добре, премахнете стари етикети и надпишете ясно подател и получател. Чупливите вещи маркирайте и опаковайте допълнително.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card text-card-fg shadow-soft\"><div class=\"p-6\"><p class=\"mb-2 flex items-center gap-2 font-display font-bold text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text h-4.5 w-4.5 text-brand-700\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg> Стойност и митница</p><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-fg\">Декларирайте реалната стойност на съдържанието. Занижаването е нарушение и може да доведе до глоби или задържане от митница. За стоки прилагаме търговска фактура.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card text-card-fg shadow-soft\"><div class=\"p-6\"><p class=\"mb-2 flex items-center gap-2 font-display font-bold text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-4.5 w-4.5 text-brand-700\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Отговорност</p><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-fg\">Грижим се за всяка пратка. Претенции се разглеждат с доказателство за съдържание и стойност. Забранени или лошо опаковани пратки, както и недекларирани ценности, не подлежат на обезщетение.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border text-card-fg shadow-soft bg-brand-50/40\"><div class=\"p-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-foreground\">Не сте сигурни за нещо? Свържете се с нас преди да донесете колета.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl bg-brand px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-fg shadow-soft transition-colors hover:bg-brand-600\" href=\"/contact\">Свържете се <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"border-t border-border bg-muted/40\"><div class=\"container grid gap-8 py-12 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"space-y-3\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 font-display font-extrabold\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" class=\"h-9 w-9 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"64\" height=\"64\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"hsl(var(--brand))\"></rect><path d=\"M14 24l18-9 18 9v16l-18 9-18-9V24z\" fill=\"#fff\" fill-opacity=\"0.08\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M14 24l18 9 18-9M32 33v16\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"15\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"hsl(var(--accent))\"></circle></svg><span class=\"leading-none\"><span class=\"block text-base tracking-tight text-foreground\">Доставки Хубенов</span><span class=\"block text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted-fg\">UK ⇄ BG</span></span></span><p class=\"max-w-xs text-sm text-muted-fg\">Доставки между Великобритания и България.</p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61554729133249\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Facebook\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2